[2026-09-01T21:19:52] QUERY 3: According to the Wikipedia article on Margaret Thatcher, what was her educational background before entering politics? Quote the relevant passage.
retrieved=[('Margaret_Thatcher.html', 1.0), ('Adolf_Hitler.html', 0.27304792708185144), ('Empire_State_Building.html', 0.2639238878326241)]
answer=According to the article, Margaret Thatcher studied at Oxford before entering politics. The relevant passage says:

> “Thatcher studied chemistry at Somerville College, Oxford, and worked briefly as a research chemist before becoming a barrister.”

It also notes in the early life section:

> “Roberts graduated in 1947 with a second-class honours degree in chemistry, and in 1950 also received the degree of Master of Arts.”

So, her educational background was chemistry at Somerville College, Oxford, where she earned a second-class honours degree, later receiving an MA.
